'''Logcutter''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife which is currently obtainable by purchasing the 15th tier of the [[Christmas Event 2024]].

==Appearance==
It has a striped red and white handle with a metallic blade and a golden pattern along the edge.

==Trivia==
*This items name and design is based off the [[Logchopper]] weapon.

